   <titleInfo>
      <title>SOLO Concert Series: Aziz Ansari</title>
   </titleInfo>
   <abstract>Tennessee Tech University's SOLO Concert Series is a major student event organized by the Student Government Association (SGA) and the SOLO Events Committee. It takes place every spring semester and is designed to bring high-profile musical acts to campus for an exciting night of entertainment. For the 2013 SOLO event, students voted for Aziz Ansari to perform a stand up comedy show on campus.</abstract>
